<title>SPAIN: Mapfre 9-mo attributable rises 11.5 pct.</title>
<headline>Mapfre 9-mo attributable rises 11.5 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results for Spanish insurance group Mapfre for the third quarter of 1996, in billions of pesetas, unless stated:</p>
<p> Attributable profit		    8.71    up   11.5 pct</p>
<p> Premium income			 249.26    up   17 pct</p>
<p>NOTE: The company said it saw premium growth in the following divisions (in billions of pesetas representing value of premiums issued):</p>
<p> Mapfre Vida			     60.5     up    8.7 pct</p>
<p> Mapfre seguros generales	    48.26    up   11.3 pct</p>
<p> Mapfre Re (reinsurance)	     53.81    up   21 pct</p>
<p>Mapfre International</p>
<p> (foreign direct insurance)	  72.67    up   22.5 pct</p>
<p> Mapfre Asistencia			9.68    up   33 pct</p>
<p> Mapfre Caucion y Credito	     n.a.    up   28.6 pct</p>
</text>
